# Skyskipper Duo "up to one other target creature you control": with only itself on the battlefield it has nothing it may target (it is
# "other"), so no target is asked for. On turn 3 Otterball Antics makes an Otter token. On turn 5 a second Duo finds the first Duo and the
# token (it may not target itself, the refusal), and Bot1 chooses the token: it is exiled and ceases to exist (CR 111.7), so nothing returns at the end step. The first Duo stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Skyskipper Duo
Skyskipper Duo
Otterball Antics
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

